<!--
  MachineBlocks — SCAD documentation

  FQN: com.machineblocks.bml.documentation.scad.LegacyConversion
-->
<block
  xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xsi:schemaLocation="http://blockml.org/bml https://blockml.org/schemas/bml.xsd
                      "
  xmlns:core="org.blockml.bml.core"
  xmlns:mbcore="com.machineblocks.bml.core"
  xmlns:scad="com.machineblocks.bml.documentation.scad">

  <name>LegacyConversion</name>
  <type>scad:LegacyConversion</type>
  <baseType>core:Documentation</baseType>
  <is>A guide to converting V2 machineblock() files to V3</is>

  <status>Draft</status>

  <documentation>
    Status: Draft — primary V2→V3 path is documented; edge cases and automated converter coverage
    are still incomplete. Expand this block as conversion rules harden.

    Module naming generations:
    v1: block() — earliest; no nesting
    v2: machineblock() — direct parameter style
    v3: mb_block() / mb_block__…() — config/settings style (current)

    Primary supported path: machineblock() (V2) → mb_block() or composite V3 Block Files.
    V1 block() may be attempted when parameters look familiar, but always warn that nesting is
    unsupported and manual testing is required.

    Conversion steps:
    1. Create V3 Block File structure and mb_block__&lt;package&gt;__&lt;Class&gt; naming.
    2. Replace machineblock(a=…) with mb_block(config, settings=[["a", …]]); use string face ids.
    3. Remove overrideConfig, *_ovr customizer vars, and deprecated *RoundingResolution params.
       Move calibration into config. Replace baseWallGapsX/Y with baseWallGaps; split old
       "both sides" entries; string sides.
    4. Wrap all geometry in a Block Module; read parameters only via getters.
    5. Multiple machineblock() calls → wrapper mb_block(base=false, studs=false) with children;
       derive shared size when needed.
    6. Child align="ccs" → wrapper alignChildren; adjust offsets.
    7. Keep split customizer UI vars; combine under Hidden into one module argument.

    Hidden section: customizer bridge only — no getters, no unitMbu/unitGrid/scale globals.
    Retrieve unitMbu, unitGrid, and scale via mb_param_* inside the module. Native parameter
    inventory for getters: NativeBlock (not legacy YAML).
  </documentation>

  <references>
    <see type="scad:BlockFileStructure" relation="Requires">
      Target Block File structure for converted modules.
    </see>
    <see type="scad:ModulePatterns" relation="SeeAlso">
      V3 pattern examples to aim for after conversion.
    </see>
    <see type="mbcore:NativeBlock" relation="Defines">
      Native parameter SSOT for getters and settings keys.
    </see>
    <see file="domains/machineblocks/machineblocks-v3-scad-target/runtimes/scad-lib/docs/01_system.md" relation="DeepDive">
      Legacy conversion section in the SCAD system doc.
    </see>
  </references>

</block>
